  <main class="inner-page"><a class="back-link" href="/">← BACK HOME</a><span class="eyebrow">ABOUT / AMIT MADAKATTI</span><h1>From raw metal<br/>to <em>cloud systems.</em></h1><p class="inner-lead">I am a Cloud & DevOps Engineer focused on building infrastructure that is automated, secure, observable and reliable.</p><div class="inner-copy"><p>My journey began with Metallurgical and Materials Engineering at NITK Surathkal. Working across different environments — manufacturing, teaching and entrepreneurship — shaped how I approach engineering: understand the system, make the process repeatable, and improve it with evidence.</p><p>Today, I work on AWS and platform engineering: Kubernetes, infrastructure as code, GitOps, progressive delivery, identity and observability. I enjoy solving the operational details that make software dependable in production.</p><p>Currently an AWS Cloud Intern at F13 Technologies, Bengaluru.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="mailto:amitpm.work@gmail.com">Start a conversation ↗</a></main>
